{"t":"Elven Amulet","s":"elven-amulet-185e9","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Elven_Amulet_359194.gif","q":4,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Elven Amulet</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Elven Amulet\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elven_Amulet_359194.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"charges\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Charges</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">50</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"resist\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Resists</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">physical +5%, fire +5%, earth +5%, energy +5%, ice +5%, holy +5%, death +5%</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Body Equipment<br/>Amulets and Necklaces</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2.70 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100 - 500 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 17, 2002<br/>Christmas Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050614180126&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elven_Amulet_359194.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an elven amulet <span class=\"p-attributes\">(protection physical +5%, fire +5%, earth +5%, energy +5%, ice +5%, holy +5%, death +5%)</span> <span class=\"p-charges\">that has 50 charges left</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.70 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Reduces <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire\">fire</a>, earth, ice, energy, death, holy and <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">physical</a> damage by exactly 5%, rounded <b>up</b> to the next whole number. This amulet is good to wear in environments where you receive several different types of damage.\n</p><p>Obtainable in <a href=\"#/quest/deeper-fibula-quest\">Deeper Fibula Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/time-ring-quest\">Time Ring Quest</a> and <a href=\"#/quest/to-blind-the-enemy-quest\">To Blind the Enemy Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>it was changed from 50 charges at 10% from fire, poison, energy and physical damage to 50 charges at 5% from physical, fire, earth, energy, ice, holy and death damage on December 2007.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arachnophobica\">Arachnophobica</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Burning%20Gladiator\">Burning Gladiator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Burster%20Spectre\">Burster Spectre</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Winter%20Rearguard\">Crazed Winter Rearguard</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Winter%20Vanguard\">Crazed Winter Vanguard</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Warden\">Crypt Warden</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed%20Prospector\">Cursed Prospector</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dharalion\">Dharalion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lamassu\">Lamassu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Memory%20of%20an%20Elf\">Memory of an Elf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sabretooth%20%28Creature%29\">Sabretooth (Creature)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tremendous%20Tyrant\">Tremendous Tyrant</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Haroun\">Haroun</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ashta%27daramai\">Ashta'daramai</a></td><td style=\"